# "You" in storied is the storied permanent's controller (CR 702.195a): Bot2 controls Fíli and Mox Sapphire, two, while
# Bot1 controls three Moxes and no storied permanent, so neither has an enduring story, and Bot1's artifacts do not count
# for Bot2. Then Bot2 casts Mox Emerald, its own third, and has the story; Bot1 still does not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Plains
Mox Sapphire
Fíli the Pathfinder
Island
Island
Mox Emerald
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Fíli the Pathfinder.Cast
